[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0010","text":"水枪！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0020","text":"哈哈，超兴奋呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0030","text":"是的！！\n可以打水枪好厉害！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0040","text":"嗯\n天气好的话，稍微淋湿一点影响也不大"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0050","text":"而且提前跟观众说明可能会淋湿的话，\n就没问题了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0060","text":"就像是用水做的游乐设施一样的感觉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0070","text":"…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0080","text":"超级期待！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0090","text":"顺便说一下，服装和小道具水枪也都有……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_01_0100","text":"试射！\n我想试试！"}]
